"OP_RETURN data": "OP_RETURN 数据",
"Off unless you turn it on. Releases come from the Arcade V1 network itself: every arcade keeps the releases signed with Strawberry's release key and hands them to the arcades it is linked to, so no website is involved. When on, this arcade installs the newest one it holds by itself (it looks every 10 minutes): the release is checked against its signed record, the old programs are kept beside the new ones (as .prev), and the service restarts cleanly. Your wallet, @handle, messages and chains stay as they are. If the app window is open, open it again after an update to load the new version.": "除非你开启，否则保持关闭。版本发布来自 Arcade V1 网络本身：每个 arcade 都保存用 Strawberry 的发布密钥签名的版本，并分发给与它相连的 arcade，不经过任何网站。开启后，本 arcade 会自动安装它持有的最新版本（每 10 分钟检查一次）：版本会与其签名记录进行核对，旧程序保留在新程序旁边（作为 .prev），服务会干净地重启。你的钱包、@handle、消息和链都保持不变。如果应用窗口是打开的，更新后请重新打开以加载新版本。",
"Off unless you turn it on. When on, this arcade tells the mesh what it runs on: the record below, exactly as it goes out, signed with this arcade's mesh key, at start, when a figure changes and about hourly. Other arcades show it beside this one on their Home tab, and the network adds it up. Figures are rounded and marked as reported; only the seal speed is measured, from this arcade's own seals. It is never written on a chain, and nothing that pays reads it. Never shared: this computer's name, user names, paths, serial numbers, MAC or IP addresses, other software. Turning it off tells every arcade to drop it at once.": "默认关闭，除非你打开。打开后，本 arcade 会告诉 mesh 它运行在什么机器上：即下面这条记录，与发出的内容完全一致，用本 arcade 的 mesh 密钥签名，在启动时、某项数字变化时以及大约每小时发送一次。其他 arcade 会在它们的主页标签中于本 arcade 旁边显示它，网络会将其汇总。数字均已取整并标为自报；只有封装速度是实测的，来自本 arcade 自己的封装。它从不写入任何链，任何涉及支付的部分都不会读取它。从不共享：这台电脑的名称、用户名、路径、序列号、MAC 或 IP 地址、其他软件。关闭后会通知每个 arcade 立即删除它。",
"Off: it asks you the first time it wants it.": "关闭：第一次需要时会询问你。",
