"Trusted coin set: taken from a copy made by {0} at block {1}; it is being re-checked from the blocks.": "受信任的币集合：取自 {0} 在区块 {1} 制作的副本；正在根据区块重新核验。",
"Tunnel command": "隧道命令",
"Turn on the {0} index for {1} in Chains & Coins to look up {2}.": "请在“链与币”中为 {1} 开启 {0} 索引，以查询 {2}。",
"Turning automatic updates off…": "正在关闭自动更新…",
"Turning automatic updates on…": "正在开启自动更新…",
"Two arcades that can't reach each other, but both reach this one, get their mesh link through it. The link is encrypted end to end: this arcade passes sealed bytes it can't read. Off by default. When the month's limit is reached, relayed links end until the next month.": "两个彼此无法直连、但都能连到本 arcade 的 arcade，可以经由它建立网络连接。连接是端到端加密的：本 arcade 只传递它无法读取的密封字节。默认关闭。达到当月限额后，中继连接将中断，直到下个月。",
"Txid": "Txid",
"Type": "类型",
"Type a page number, or # and a number.": "请输入页码，或 # 加编号。",
