"Uninstall": "卸载",
"Unpair": "取消配对",
"Until it catches up, the borrowed copy answers balances and sends ({0} lender{1}, {2}).": "追上之前，由借用副本提供余额和发送（{0} 个出借方，{2}）。",
"Until it catches up, the borrowed copy answers balances and sends ({0}).": "追上之前，由借用副本提供余额和发送（{0}）。",
