"Waiting transactions": "等待中的交易",
"Wallet": "钱包",
"Wallet access": "钱包访问",
"Wallet restored. If it had a name, it shows here once this arcade or another can read it from the chain.": "钱包已恢复。如果它有名称，在本 arcade 或其他 arcade 从链上读到后会显示在这里。",
"Wallet restored: you're @{0} again.": "钱包已恢复：你又是 @{0} 了。",
"What": "内容",
"What it did": "执行的操作",
"What paid it": "付款内容",
"What you claim and the coins move in one transaction, or neither does.": "你认领的东西和币在同一笔交易中转移，要么都成功，要么都不发生。",
"Where it is written. ARCADE by default; Pepecoin testnet while ARCADE is stalled.": "写入位置。默认为 ARCADE；ARCADE 停滞时使用 Pepecoin 测试网。",
"Which chains do you plan to use?": "你打算使用哪些链？",
"Which kind of address this wallet shows and sends from": "此钱包显示并用于发送的地址类型",
"Which wallet": "选择钱包",
"Who to? A @tag, an address or a messaging key.": "发给谁？一个 @tag、地址或消息密钥。",
"Why": "原因",
"Why: your @handle is published on the {0} chain, and publishing pays a small network fee. {1} is the test coin of that chain; it has no money value.": "原因：你的 @handle 发布在 {0} 链上，发布需要支付少量网络手续费。{1} 是该链的测试币，没有货币价值。",
"Window": "窗口",
"Winning inscription": "胜出铭文",
"With a price, each arcade pays for what it sends through this relay past its free allowance, in ARCADE to this arcade's wallet. A payment counts once it is in a block. An arcade past what it paid has its relayed links ended until it pays.": "设定价格后，每个 arcade 超出免费额度、经由此中继发送的流量都需付费，以 ARCADE 支付到本 arcade 的钱包。付款打包进区块后才算数。超出已付金额的 arcade，其中继连接会被中断，直到付款为止。",
"Wojak": "Wojak",
"Wojakcoin": "Wojakcoin",
"Worn": "使用中",
"Write a message…": "写消息…",
"Write these 12 words down, in order, and keep them somewhere safe. They are shown once, and they're the only way to get your wallet and @handle back.": "请按顺序抄写这 12 个助记词，并保存在安全的地方。它们只显示一次，而且是找回你的钱包和 @handle 的唯一方式。",
"Write these 12 words down.": "请抄写这 12 个助记词。",
"Writes blocks": "写入区块",
"Written by": "写入者",
"You follow": "你关注了",
"You give {0} and get {1}, with {2}. One transaction: both move, or neither does.": "你付出 {0}，得到 {1}，附带 {2}。一笔交易：双方同时转移，要么都不发生。",
"You left {0}.": "你已退出 {0}。",
"You:": "你：",
"Your 12 words": "你的 12 个助记词",
"Your ARCADE earnings": "你的 ARCADE 收益",
"Your account's words are kept on the arcade that holds your account, sealed under your password; any arcade hands out the sealed copy and only your password opens it, here on this PC. Your imported wallets, groups, address book and blocked list come with it. The password is not stored.": "你账户的助记词保存在持有你账户的 arcade 上，用你的密码加密封存；任何 arcade 都会提供这份封存副本，但只有你的密码能在这台电脑上打开它。你导入的钱包、群组、通讯录和屏蔽列表也会一起带来。密码不会被保存。",
"Your addresses on your profile": "个人资料中的地址",
"Your apps": "我的应用",
"Your arcade account": "你的 arcade 账户",
"Your arcade is still reading the {0} chain (block {1} of {2}, {3}%); the coin shows once it gets there.": "你的 arcade 仍在读取 {0} 链（区块 {1} / {2}，{3}%）；读到那里后币就会显示。",
"Your chains are chosen.": "链已选好。",
"Your messaging key": "你的消息密钥",
"Your name on the arcade (2–24 characters: a–z, 0–9 and _), seen by every arcade. Pick it here once your wallet is made.": "你在 arcade 上的名称（2–24 个字符：a–z、0–9 和 _），所有 arcade 都能看到。钱包创建后在这里选择。",
"Your name on the arcade (2–24 characters: a–z, 0–9 and _). It's published on the chain, so every arcade sees it.": "你在 arcade 上的名称（2–24 个字符：a–z、0–9 和 _）。它发布在链上，所以所有 arcade 都能看到。",
